note.p:
The eight telegrams and one despatch attached to this memorandum are not here
                    printed. The telegrams from Djakarta were as follows: No. 545, October 20, 1950;
                    No. 594, October 31, 1950; No. 604, November 3, 1950; No. 896, January 8, 1951;
                    No. 1002, January 26, 1951; No. 1032, February 3, 1951; No. 1061, February 10,
                    1951; and No. 1083, February 14, 1951. The despatch was No. 560, January 19,
                    1951.
